@startuml
title Diagrama de estados — Reclamo
!include ../estilo-vp.iuml
hide empty description
state "Pendiente\n(PENDING)" as PENDING
state "En proceso\n(IN_PROCESS)" as IN_PROCESS
state "Resuelto\n(RESOLVED)" as RESOLVED
state "Rechazado\n(REJECTED)" as REJECTED

[*] --> PENDING : registrarReclamo() [el pedido es del cliente]
PENDING --> IN_PROCESS : tomarReclamo() [administrador]
PENDING --> RESOLVED : resolverReclamo(nota) [se acepta]
PENDING --> REJECTED : resolverReclamo(nota) [se rechaza]
IN_PROCESS --> RESOLVED : resolverReclamo(nota) [se acepta]
IN_PROCESS --> REJECTED : resolverReclamo(nota) [se rechaza]
RESOLVED --> IN_PROCESS : reabrirReclamo()
REJECTED --> IN_PROCESS : reabrirReclamo()

note bottom of RESOLVED
  Un reclamo cerrado no se vuelve a cerrar:
  para cambiar la resolución primero se reabre.
  Ningún camino vuelve a Pendiente.
end note
@enduml
